<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-10-26T15:20:35.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:20:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella confirmed that two National Liberation Army leaders were killed, and a strike in Cauca eliminated ten ELN fighters, while another operation killed ten ELN rebels. A drone strike in Guapi wounded four soldiers and killed one Marine, and a car bomb at Casanare toll booths injured four women. A Colombian rapper stomped on an Israeli flag during a performance, a quake killed over 250 people, and a mine collapse in Nariño killed 14 miners; Santa Marta declared a red alert over flash floods. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQSjMzYm5rSFFhUlc3OTJIeGpjWENRakF6MEhjT0RCUGpaQ0otX0lyMV9TNWdnM0xpMUNXNEhaZlVjb0RXWXFqcGJycU9tN3ZXSHlzSkp5ODktZ3psNUtyN0lTWEhiVHlKd1lIQXpLaUdIOXRuS3NhZG90VTVubGxCdEtPV0pSVGh1U2t0b3I4Q25jWWtNOWZWOTI1Qk81ZENaM01n?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE9rUWRDMGFYQS0wNXNLZUVTdC0ta3cySXdBQ0NhMFZmVFo0QVpScjhsbkpFMlR5Wm11dTVINTVpdFFHNkxTdnlXNmlGemtzZE5zb1RqMlladUFyUG9qdmstdm9WZmNObGR4QllQWHo4b25odw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Bureau | Sam Cooper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5iWEpRZEFpMU1UemQxaUttQkxZanB1X3FEMWpuMFBURGYzckhwYzBXYmk3MkJaNC1JMHdIRGlxdGtuVXJPV3N6OVNuLUJ6LTh5cGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;North American Congress on Latin America (NACLA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPb1cyY25UQ1V6TkxSZjdpWlZXVXl5TjdURW9SSkU3bGNoTWhva2lqMFN1NElsa0NuV2p3UDhMMlkxTXRzeUNuTWNxa1hmZEFHQnYtbENGTWtXdDdFZGhJdDJCYzdPVmhUaFFlZmFtTTY5WVphRFZaaVlsbzZpamJ0VVYtM28yNC1VYm5jVUpB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Colombia Reports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNQU4ybkVnRmFQZ3k2MHdrMUpXSDhOamlnUk1OWGEtV0JQVElEaEtqMlMxVG9fRXJ0eH